\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs22 \f3\fs22  }{\plain \fs24 \b\f3 An Exhortation}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 This Exhortation may be used, in whole or in part, either during the\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Liturgy or at other times. In the absence of a deacon or priest, this\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Exhortation may be read by a lay person. The people stand or sit.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Beloved in the Lord: Our Savior Christ, on the night before\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 he suffered, instituted the Sacrament of his Body and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Blood as a sign and pledge of his love, for the continual\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 remembrance of the sacrifice of his death, and for a spiritual\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 sharing in his risen life. For in these holy Mysteries we are\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 made one with Christ, and Christ with us; we are made one\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 body in him, and members one of another.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Having in mind, therefore, his great love for us, and in\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 obedience to his command, his Church renders to Almighty\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 God our heavenly Father never-ending thanks for the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 creation of the world, for his continual providence over us,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 for his love for all mankind, and for the redemption of the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 world by our Savior Christ, who took upon himself our flesh,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and humbled himself even to death on the cross, that he\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 might make us the children of God by the power of the Holy\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Spirit, and exalt us to everlasting life.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 But if we are to share rightly in the celebration of those holy\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Mysteries, and be nourished by that spiritual Food, we must \softline
remember the dignity of that holy Sacrament. I therefore call\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 upon you to consider how Saint Paul exhorts all persons to\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 prepare themselves carefully before eating of that Bread and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 drinking of that Cup.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 For, as the benefit is great, if with penitent hearts and living\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 faith we receive the holy Sacrament, so is the danger great, if\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 we receive it improperly, not recognizing the Lord{\u8217\'92}s Body.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Judge yourselves, therefore, lest you be judged by the Lord.\par
}\column 
\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Examine your lives and conduct by the rule of God{\u8217\'92}s\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 commandments, that you may perceive wherein you have \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 offended in what you have done or left undone, whether in\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 thought, word, or deed. And acknowledge your sins before \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Almighty God, with full purpose of amendment of life, being\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 ready to make restitution for all injuries and wrongs done by\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 you to others; and also being ready to forgive those who have\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 offended you, in order that you yourselves may be forgiven.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 And then, being reconciled with one another, come to the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 banquet of that most heavenly Food.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 And if, in your preparation, you need help and counsel, then\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 go and open your grief to a discreet and understanding priest,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and confess your sins, that you may receive the benefit of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 absolution, and spiritual counsel and advice; to the removal\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 of scruple and doubt, the assurance of pardon, and the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 strengthening of your faith.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx612\tx1152\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8532\tx9072\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 To Christ our Lord who loves us, and washed us in his own\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 blood, and made us a kingdom of priests to serve his God\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and Father, to him be glory in the Church evermore. Through\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 him let us offer continually the sacrifice of praise, which is\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 our bounden duty and service, and, with faith in him, come\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 boldly before the throne of grace [and humbly confess our\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 sins to Almighty God].\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \b\f3 The Decalogue: Traditional}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 God spake these words, and said:\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 I am the Lord thy God who brought thee out of the land of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Egypt, out of the house of bondage. Thou shalt have none\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 other gods but me.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 Lord have mercy upon us,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f3 and incline our hearts to keep this law}{\plain \fs24 \f3 .\par
}
