}{\plain \fs24 \f3   With the Father and the Son he is worshiped and glorified.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   He has spoken through the Prophets.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   We believe in one holy catholic and apostolic Church.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   We acknowledge one baptism for the forgiveness of sins.\par
