}{\plain \fs24 \f3     the only-begotten Son of God,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 begotten of his Father before all worlds,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     God of God, Light of Light,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     very God of very God,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     begotten, not made,\par
