}{\plain \fs24 \f3   and was incarnate by the Holy Ghost of the Virgin Mary,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3         and was made man;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   and was crucified also for us under Pontius Pilate;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   he suffered and was buried;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   and the third day he rose again according to the Scriptures,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   and ascended into heaven,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   and sitteth on the right hand of the Father;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   and he shall come again, with glory,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3         to judge both the quick and the dead;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   whose kingdom shall have no end.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 And I believe in the Holy Ghost the Lord, and Giver of Life, \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 who proceedeth from the Father and the Son;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     who with the Father and the Son together is worshiped\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3         and glorified;\par
